## Bounded independent review (implement approval)

**Policy:** `references/adversarial-review.md` and `references/implementation-review.md`
**Cycle:** `refactor-N`

Use the current manifest review epoch.
**Cycle bound:** one broad discovery pass; one consolidated blocker/major batch; one remediation; focused verification of original `RV-*` IDs; at most one targeted correction/reverification

**Auditor (fresh subagent):** {{self-declared label; not the implementer}}
**Auditor command:** `node "$SKILL_DIR/scripts/review-log.mjs" record --id {{id}} --phase refactor --cycle refactor-N --role auditor --reviewer "<label>" --verdict <approved|changes-requested> --finding '<structured finding JSON>'`

| ID | Severity | Category | Evidence | Concrete impact | Alternative | Disposition | Remediation | Focused verification |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|

<!-- Add a row only for each issued RV finding. Use Disposition: resolved | unresolved. -->

**Verifier (distinct fresh subagent):** {{self-declared label; not the implementer or auditor}}
**Verifier verdict:** pending | approved | changes-requested
**Verifier command:** `node "$SKILL_DIR/scripts/review-log.mjs" record --id {{id}} --phase refactor --cycle refactor-N --role verifier --reviewer "<distinct label>" --verdict approved --resolution RV-001=resolved`
**Verification scope:** original RV IDs plus any remediation-caused blocker regression recorded through `--regression`; no broad rediscovery or new low/major findings
**Targeted correction/reverification used:** no | yes - {{original RV IDs and blocker regression closed through `--regression-resolution`}}
